spawn and explicit placement are B; caret/selection/IME preedit are C. Name
reroll, settings/graph/Go-to screen activation, preset/banner hosting, dwell,
drag, resize and Locate/fx painting remain the later L8/W3.2c surfaces. The
accepted focus core emits Locate exactly; A logs those events and retains the
post-stage-layout timing, with no new effects painter.


